## Branch flow (required)
- Contributors work on `dev`.
- Maintainers merge `dev` -> `pre-release` via PR.
- Maintainers merge `pre-release` -> `main` via PR.

## Output style (required)
- Do not use emojis or other non-ASCII glyphs in code, CLI output, test output, logs, or docs.
- Use ASCII-only status markers (e.g., `[OK]`, `[ERROR]`, `PASS/FAIL`) to avoid Windows console encoding issues.
